{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b19d6cef-cbd8-8c3c-9276-f215fd7eeada",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:11:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning, I'm calling because the low spot at the end of my block is under about a foot of water, it's been like that since the rain on Monday after all that snow came down Sunday, and I walked down there this morning and the drain is just sitting there with water over the curb and up onto the sidewalk, and a neighbor told me it happens every big rain, every single one, so this is not new, and I'm at 473 Pelham Street up on the Hill, and I want to know when anybody last came by to look at it, because it sure doesn't look like anyone has."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 473 Pelham, and the water's at the end of the block, not right in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the end of the block, the low spot, where it dips. My house is a few doors up. Cars are driving through it and throwing water everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull up the records on that and see what's logged. Hold please, just a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you can help me with that right now? Great, because I was going to say, somebody needs to just go clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I meant hold on the line, I'm going to put you on a brief hold while I look. I'll be right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. Yeah, sure, I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting, Ms. Cullen. Okay, I'm seeing a couple of older entries for catch basin cleaning in that area, but nothing that looks recent. I can't see from here exactly when a crew was last at that specific drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So nothing recent. That's what I figured. It's every big rain and nobody's been out, that's the part that gets me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm going to put in a service request for the drain at the end of the block on Pelham, flag it as standing water over the curb, and send it to the crew supervisor. Crews are stretched thin right after a storm like this one, but it will be in the queue with your report on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can somebody call me back about when they'll actually get there? My number's 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196, I have that. I'll note that you want a call back and a date for when they last cleaned it. If it gets deeper or starts reaching homes, call right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you. I just hope someone actually comes this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. You're all set on my end. Take care."
    }
  ],
